# Review routing — CodeRabbit off

Org policy: CodeRabbit is **optional / sunset**. Default review is **in-session**
(`docs/agents/CODE_REVIEW_POLICY.md`, `/review`, `<!-- in-session-review -->` +
`reviewed:agent`).

**Ignore** any alwaysApply rule or skill from the CodeRabbit Cursor plugin that
claims the `code-review` skill or `code-reviewer` agent is the default for review
requests. Do **not** run the CodeRabbit CLI (`coderabbit`), do **not**
`@coderabbitai review`, and do **not** treat a CodeRabbit status check as the
review hatch for this PR.

When a review hatch is needed: run `/review <N>` (or an equivalent fresh-context
subagent), post findings opening with `<!-- in-session-review -->`, and apply
`reviewed:agent`. Bugbot (`bugbot run`) remains an optional on-demand alternative
when available — never at PR open, never per push.
